plan error: LogicalPlanError: Query planning error: size([x IN list WHERE (pattern)]) is only supported when the pattern is a SINGLE hop with the iteration variable at one endpoint (e.g. `(x)-[:REL]->()`, `()-[:REL]->(x)`, or undirected `(x)-[:REL]-()`); a multi-hop, self-loop `(x)-[:REL]->(x)`, or variable-length pattern would return a wrong count and is not yet supported (#629). Workaround: correlate the pattern to an outer variable, or express the constrained count via a top-level MATCH ... WHERE ... WITH count(...).